# lodash is an unmaintained transitive of the alchemy CLI (alchemy ->
# @prisma/dev -> @mrleebo/prisma-ast -> chevrotain -> lodash@4.17.21).
# All advisories below share the same root cause: lodash has no patched
# release (advisory ranges extend past the latest 4.17.21). The code is
# dev-time deploy tooling, never bundled into the deployed Cloudflare
# Worker, and no application path passes untrusted template options.
